The skill's `validate_figures.py` failed with `No module named 'src'`, so I checked the manifest with `jsonschema` instead. `compile_latex.sh` stopped on a missing `pdftotext`, so I compiled with `pdflatex` and `bibtex` directly.

The orchestrator's concept-figure step may still try to render `overview_pipeline`. If it succeeds, it will overwrite my fallback files. The manifest's fallback fields should stay consistent with whatever it leaves.
